    "detailed_description": "\u2589\u300aTravel cat : Adventure  Island\u300bhas a Japanese illustration style and rich object design.<br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942060/extras/940ad1f6596da619f5da5497a84b210a.poster.avif?t=1715099904\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942060/extras/940ad1f6596da619f5da5497a84b210a.webm?t=1715099904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942060/extras/940ad1f6596da619f5da5497a84b210a.mp4?t=1715099904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>This is a comprehensive game that allows you to happily plant trees, vegetables, and a variety of strange plants in an island farm simulation. When you first enter the game, the island will randomly generate types, but if you like more lighting, green spaces, or golden grasslands, the game can completely and unlimitedly generate new maps until you find your dream home. In the map, you can freely design and arrange every inch of land you step on, do various planning and arrangement that you like, plant flowers or crops, build your own small house, decorate with various furniture, and even raise cute cats.<br><br>\u2589\u300aTravel cat : Adventure  Island\u300b Artfully designed special modeling trees.<br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942060/extras/b0eda7eb061e4542118268f6dd546f14.poster.avif?t=1715099904\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942060/extras/b0eda7eb061e4542118268f6dd546f14.webm?t=1715099904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942060/extras/b0eda7eb061e4542118268f6dd546f14.mp4?t=1715099904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The game provides a supply shop where players can exchange and purchase items, seeds, furniture, and household items as long as they have the corresponding resources and currency. The trees are adorned with roasty toasty cotton candy, mushroom covered in gold coins, and ice cream trees, among others. The diverse and unique plants will surprise you on your journey of exploration!<br><br>\u2589\u300aTravel cat : Adventure  Island\u300bCute animal night market stalls<br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942060/extras/37df17821e540dbfc5f232a2fa5891a8.poster.avif?t=1715099904\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942060/extras/37df17821e540dbfc5f232a2fa5891a8.webm?t=1715099904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942060/extras/37df17821e540dbfc5f232a2fa5891a8.mp4?t=1715099904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Do you like the feeling of your island being empty and not alive? Players can design the island into their own island night market feeling, the game currently provides nearly 20 kinds of cute animal booths waiting for players to unlock, they will be able to help players earn money, even if the player shut down the game, until the next online, you can still go to each booth one by one to collect money, to experience the feeling of being a small animal boss.<br><br>\u2589\u300aTravel cat : Adventure  Island\u300bgenerate their own island<br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942060/extras/09bdfa7f63c1cdf9a9ec91d9845be9e0.avif?t=1715099904\" /></div><br><br>This is a comprehensive game that island farm simulation. Players will have their own player island to design and arrange, and can build buildings, raise pets, grow vegetables and arrange furniture on the island.<br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942060/extras/4ac276043f275ab172bce11a2689cd36.poster.avif?t=1715099904\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942060/extras/4ac276043f275ab172bce11a2689cd36.webm?t=1715099904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>\u2589\u300aTravel cat : Adventure  Island\u300bSteam Cloud<br><br>The game supports with Steam Cloud cloud archive backup service, players hard work to design the island layout, after each off game will be safely backed up to the cloud, do not have to worry about the loss of small island archives.<br><br>\u2589\u300aTravel cat : Adventure  Island\u300bPlayers can zoom the map to see their own island<br><br>Can't see the whole picture of your own island? Press Ctrl + Mouse UP/Mouse Down to zoom in and zoom out the map freely.<br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942060/extras/774ef203d7490c1e80c4b6999417b76c.poster.avif?t=1715099904\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942060/extras/774ef203d7490c1e80c4b6999417b76c.webp?t=1715099904\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br>\u2589\u300aTravel cat : Adventure  Island\u300bOfficial Discord~<br>Welcome to join the official DISCORD to report any comments or bugs : ",
